sequenceDiagram
    %% the ten arrow tokens
    participant A
    participant B
    A->B: solid open
    A-->B: dotted open
    A->>B: solid arrow
    A-->>B: dotted arrow
    A<<->>B: solid both
    A<<-->>B: dotted both
    A-xB: solid cross
    A--xB: dotted cross
    A-)B: solid async
    A--)B: dotted async
    A-xA: to itself
